From 8e7265e5d60baa5cd094bcbc5a92c045b08072bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Yu <richard.yu@mitrastar.com.tw>
Date: Tue, 10 Jun 2025 07:17:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fronthaul: refresh_vaps_info: clarify reason for copying
 map

Adds a comment above saved_vaps_copy to explain why a snapshot of
m_radio_info.available_vaps is needed during iteration.

The clarification helps avoid confusion by explicitly stating that
modifying the original map during iteration would otherwise lead to
undefined behavior.

Suggested-by: Volodymyr Pavlenko
Signed-off-by: Richard Yu <richard.yu@mitrastar.com.tw>
